# The packages of the replay image, in replay/Dockerfile. `make lock-replay` writes requirements.txt with hashes.
# vitaldb decodes the publisher's case files. confluent-kafka writes to and reads from Kafka. fastavro encodes and decodes the Avro bodies.
# boto3 reads the landed object versions from S3 on the host.
